  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:maran_divishmaya/slave">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/1"/>Master in heaven, we beseech You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/2"/>as a slave implores his master.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/3"/>We are oppressed and live in darkness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/4"/>our souls are grieved
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/5"/>from great affliction.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/6"/>We don’t have the strength to appease You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/7"/>Master, do it for the sake of the covenant,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:maran_divishmaya/slave/8"/>which You made with our forefathers.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
